teraform:-

1. What is Terraform?

English:
Terraform is an Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tool developed by HashiCorp. 
It allows you to create, update, and manage infrastructure using configuration files.

Marathi:
Terraform हे HashiCorp ने विकसित केलेले Infrastructure as Code (IaC) टूल आहे. 
याच्या मदतीने आपण कोड वापरून सर्व्हर, नेटवर्क आणि क्लाउड रिसोर्सेस तयार व व्यवस्थापित करू शकतो.

2. What is Infrastructure as Code (IaC)?

English:
Infrastructure as Code means managing infrastructure using code instead of manual configuration.

Marathi:
Infrastructure as Code म्हणजे Infrastructure मॅन्युअली तयार करण्याऐवजी कोडद्वारे तयार आणि व्यवस्थापित करणे.

3. What are Terraform Providers?

English:
Providers are plugins that allow Terraform to interact with cloud platforms like AWS, 
Azure, Google Cloud, Kubernetes, VMware, etc.

Marathi:
Provider म्हणजे Terraform ला AWS, Azure, GCP, Kubernetes यांसारख्या प्लॅटफॉर्मशी जोडणारे Plugin.

4. What is a Resource?

English:
A resource is any infrastructure object managed by Terraform, such as an EC2 instance, S3 bucket, or VPC.

Marathi:
Resource म्हणजे Terraform ने तयार किंवा व्यवस्थापित केलेला Infrastructure Object.

5. What is a Provider Block?

English:
The provider block specifies which cloud platform Terraform should use.

Example

provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

Marathi:
Provider Block मध्ये Terraform कोणता Cloud Provider वापरणार आहे हे सांगितले जाते.

6. What are Terraform Variables?

English:
Variables allow you to make your code reusable and configurable.

Marathi:
Variables वापरून एकाच कोडचा वेगवेगळ्या ठिकाणी पुन्हा वापर करता येतो.

7. What are Outputs?

English:
Outputs display useful information after Terraform finishes applying the configuration.

Marathi:
Output म्हणजे Apply झाल्यानंतर मिळणारी माहिती जसे IP Address किंवा Bucket Name.

8. What is Terraform State?

English:
Terraform State is a file that stores information about the infrastructure Terraform manages.

Marathi:
Terraform State File मध्ये Infrastructure ची सध्याची माहिती साठवली जाते.

9. What is terraform.tfstate?

English:
It stores the current state of infrastructure.

Marathi:
हा Infrastructure चा वर्तमान स्टेट साठवणारा फाइल आहे.

10. Why is Terraform State Important?

English:
Terraform uses the state file to determine what changes need to be made.

Marathi:
Terraform कोणते बदल करायचे हे State File वरून ठरवतो.

Important Terraform Commands
11. terraform init

English:
Initializes the Terraform project.

Marathi:
Terraform Project सुरू करण्यासाठी वापरला जातो.

12. terraform plan

English:
Shows what changes Terraform will make.

Marathi:
कोणते बदल होणार आहेत ते दाखवतो.

13. terraform apply

English:
Creates or updates infrastructure.

Marathi:
Infrastructure तयार किंवा अपडेट करतो.

14. terraform destroy

English:
Deletes all infrastructure managed by Terraform.

Marathi:
Terraform ने तयार केलेले सर्व Resources हटवतो.

15. terraform validate

English:
Checks the syntax of Terraform files.

Marathi:
Terraform फाइल्सची Syntax तपासतो.

16. terraform fmt

English:
Formats Terraform code.

Marathi:
Terraform कोड व्यवस्थित फॉरमॅट करतो.

17. terraform show

English:
Displays the current state.

Marathi:
सध्याची Infrastructure माहिती दाखवतो.

18. terraform output

English:
Displays output values.

Marathi:
Output Values दाखवतो.

Scenario Questions
19. Difference between terraform apply and terraform plan?

English:

Plan → Preview changes
Apply → Execute changes

Marathi:

Plan → बदल आधी दाखवतो.
Apply → बदल प्रत्यक्ष करतो.
20. Difference between Count and for_each?

English:

count uses indexes.
for_each uses keys and is better for maps or sets.

Marathi:

Count मध्ये Index वापरला जातो.
for_each मध्ये Key वापरली जाते.
21. What are Modules?

English:
Modules are reusable Terraform configurations.

Marathi:
Module म्हणजे पुन्हा वापरता येणारा Terraform Code.

22. What are Workspaces?

English:
Workspaces allow multiple environments like Dev, Test, and Production.

Marathi:
Workspace वापरून Dev, Test आणि Production वेगवेगळे ठेवता येतात.

23. What is Remote Backend?

English:
A remote backend stores the Terraform state in a shared location, such as an S3 bucket.

Marathi:
Remote Backend मध्ये State File क्लाउडवर साठवला जातो, त्यामुळे टीममधील सर्वजण तो वापरू शकतात.

24. What is State Locking?

English:
State locking prevents multiple users from modifying the state at the same time.

Marathi:
एकाच वेळी दोन जण State File बदलू शकत नाहीत यासाठी State Locking वापरले जाते.

25. What are Provisioners?

English:
Provisioners execute scripts or commands on a resource after it is created.

Marathi:
Resource तयार झाल्यानंतर Commands किंवा Scripts चालवण्यासाठी Provisioners वापरले जातात.

Real-Time Interview Questions
Q. Why do companies use Terraform?

English:
To automate infrastructure, reduce manual errors, improve consistency, and support version control.

Marathi:
Infrastructure ऑटोमेट करण्यासाठी, मानवी चुका कमी करण्यासाठी, एकसारखी कॉन्फिगरेशन ठेवण्यासाठी आणि Version Control साठी.

Q. Why Terraform instead of CloudFormation?

English:
Terraform is cloud-agnostic and supports multiple cloud providers, while CloudFormation is specific to AWS.

Marathi:
Terraform अनेक Cloud Providers साठी वापरता येतो, पण CloudFormation फक्त AWS साठी आहे.

Q. What happens when you run terraform apply?

English:
Terraform compares the configuration with the current state, 
creates an execution plan, and then creates, updates, or deletes resources as required.

Marathi:
Terraform Configuration आणि State File ची तुलना करून आवश्यक Resources तयार, अपडेट किंवा हटवतो.

Common HR Question
Tell me about your Terraform experience.

English:
"I have experience using Terraform to automate cloud infrastructure. 
I have worked with providers such as AWS, created resources like EC2 instances, 
VPCs, S3 buckets, and IAM roles, managed state files, used modules for reusable code, 
and followed Infrastructure as Code best practices."

Marathi:
"मी Terraform वापरून Cloud Infrastructure ऑटोमेट केले आहे. 
AWS Provider वापरून EC2, VPC, S3 Bucket, IAM Roles तयार केले आहेत. 
State Files व्यवस्थापित केले, Modules वापरले आणि Infrastructure as Code च्या सर्वोत्तम पद्धतींचे पालन केले."
